              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:25",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "But if ye do not forgive, neither will your Father which is in heaven forgive your trespasses.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "D&C 64:9 (7–10)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:26",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "And they come again to Jerusalem: and as he was walking in the temple, there come to him the chief priests, and the scribes, and the elders,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:27",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And say unto him, By what authority doest thou these things? and who gave thee this authority to do these things?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "TG Priesthood, Authority."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Priesthood, Authority.",
            "prettyString": "TG Priesthood, Authority",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Priesthood, Authority",
                "entryId": "tg-priesthood-authority",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:28",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "And Jesus answered and said unto them, I will also ask of you one question, and answer me, and I will tell you by what authority I do these things.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:29",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "The baptism of John, was it from heaven, or of men? answer me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 27
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 30,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:30",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "And they reasoned with themselves, saying, If we shall say, From heaven; he will say, Why then did ye not believe him?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:31",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "But if we shall say, Of men; they feared the people: for all men counted John, that he was a prophet indeed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 64
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:32",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "And they answered and said unto Jesus, We cannot tell. And Jesus answering saith unto them, Neither do I tell you by what authority I do these things.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 33,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mark 11:33",
        "book": "Mark",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 33
      }
    ]
